<b>Wait! What’s a case number?</b><br/><br/>
We recently implemented Salesforce as our new Customer Relationship Management (CRM) system. As part of this, any questions, feedback<br/> or issues we receive via phone calls or emails, will now be assigned a case number. This allows us to more easily pull up all communications <br/> and updates associated with your requests so we can follow-up quickly.<br/><br/>
Habits can be hard to break, so don’t worry! We can still track any questions using your purchase order or sales order number. <br/>Your case number just gives us another way to make sure we are always providing great service.<br/><br/>
All the best,<br/><br/>
